=begin

  Keeps Blink (1215) and Focus Barrier (1216) up. Blink is recast first
  because it drops on a successful avoidance.

  Recasts wait for roundtime and use Spell#cast (incant + type-ahead retry)
  so the command is not buried behind combat input. There is no Lich call
  that inserts in front of the game's type-ahead queue.

  After a cast, waits until Infomon shows the spell active instead of a
  fixed pause. Prep refusals (can't think clearly, etc.) back off instead
  of hammering incant.

  Usage:
    ;monks_keeper            - start
    ;monks_keeper kill       - stop (or ;kill monks_keeper)

        author: loraque (loraque@gmail.com)
          game: Gemstone
          tags: monk, magic, utility
      required: Lich >= 5.12.0
       version: 0.3.0

  changelog:
    0.3.0 (2026-09-09)
      wait until Spell#active? after a successful cast
      back off on "can't think clearly enough" and similar prep refusals
    0.2.0 (2026-09-09)
      waitcastrt? + waitrt? instead of nonexistent wait_castrt (script was
        crashing when Blink dropped)
      Spell#cast instead of nonexistent putbeforerequest
      Spell.affordable? / Char.mana (mental acuity spends stamina)
      skip recast while dead, stunned, or webbed
    0.1.0
      initial keep-alive loop for 1215/1216

=end

POLL = 0.1
LOW_ENERGY_PAUSE = 5
ACTIVE_WAIT = 3.0
PREP_REFUSED = /
  can't think clearly enough to prepare a spell|
  concentrating too intently|
  unable to do that right now|
  don't seem to be able to move|
  All you manage to do is cough up some blood
/ix

SPELLS = [
  Spell[1215], # Blink -- drops on a successful avoidance
  Spell[1216], # Focus Barrier
].freeze

loop do
  if dead? || checkstunned || checkwebbed
    pause POLL
    next
  end

  need = SPELLS.find { |spell| !spell.active? }
  unless need
    pause POLL
    next
  end

  unless need.affordable?
    echo "Warning: not enough energy to refresh #{need.name} (#{need.num})."
    pause LOW_ENERGY_PAUSE
    next
  end

  waitrt?
  waitcastrt?

  result = need.cast
  if result == false || (result.is_a?(String) && result =~ PREP_REFUSED)
    pause LOW_ENERGY_PAUSE
    next
  end

  deadline = Time.now + ACTIVE_WAIT
  pause POLL until need.active? || Time.now >= deadline
  pause LOW_ENERGY_PAUSE unless need.active?
end
